  "described": {
    "alt_text": "A square four panel painting of a mirrored crowd of cartoon creatures with a large blue two eyed creature at centre, in translucent rainbow washes with black outlines.",
    "description": "A square painting on four joined wood panels with visible seams. Mirrored left to right, with a large sky blue creature with two eyes, a white horn and a visor straddling the centre seam, surrounded by lime, yellow, orange, red, pink and purple creatures with single eyes, white horns and dots. Blue globes at the upper corners, a purple sphere at upper left. Overlapping translucent washes and thick black outlines, with white highlights on horns and tabs.",
    "impression": "The one reassembled crowd with a clear protagonist: the big blue creature in the middle, made whole by the mirror, looking out with both eyes. The crowd becomes its court. It is the most settled of the four, a monster portrait inside a monster pattern.",
